# H-RS1 A/B for D-INODE-CLUSTER-PUBLISH-WITHOUT-AUTHORITY on 2/disk/caw/direct
# g2b (test15 test16), the configuration of lfb2.  Same build for both arms:
# ~/src/mxfs-c srcversion D2472E4A4BED5A6D8DC8AF8 (see
# tests/queues/rs1_skip_ab_3node.queue for the build, the knob and the
# hypothesis).  Run from ~/src/mxfs-c.  Every other setting is exactly
# tests/queues/freed_nodelay_caw.queue's (production settings: both test delays
# off); NG0_RS1_SKIP alternates 0 (control) and 1 (fix).
#
# READING RULES: tests/queues/rs1_skip_ab_3node.queue's, written before the
# first lap of either queue; the two queues are graded as one campaign.
#
# Bound: the freed_nodelay laps' 1680 s per lap (they ran 472-597 s).
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_RS1_SKIP=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh rk1 1 300 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
